# Environment presets (M49): the windmill field (v0.0.14: the lakeshore
# until it moved to the Showcase) starts in its own light, switches at once
# and blended through the presets, and back to its own light. Rain (M50)
# fills the air with drops; dry, they're gone. Water and its reflection
# under the presets: the Showcase's tour.
goto_level windmill_field
wait_for_level windmill_field
expect_environment level

environment rain
expect_environment rain
wait 0.3
expect_particles >= 1000             # M50: it rains (outdoors)
environment sunset 1.5
wait 0.1
expect_environment (blending)
wait 1.6
expect_environment sunset

environment overcast 0.5
wait 0.7
expect_environment overcast
environment fog 0.5
wait 0.7
expect_environment fog
environment night 0.5
wait 0.2
environment clear_day 0.5            # a change of mind mid-blend
wait 0.7
expect_environment clear_day

environment level
expect_environment level
wait 0.3
expect_particles < 500               # dry again: the field's leaves (~200), no rain
